# Generated files. `make gen` writes each from its source under docs/data/, and a freshness
# gate fails a stale one. Marking them keeps them out of GitHub's language stats and folds
# them in review; they stay committed, because docs/ is read on GitHub and by kb.mjs with no
# build step.
docs/data/prerequisites.json      linguist-generated=true
docs/reference/gates.md           linguist-generated=true
docs/reference/glossary.md        linguist-generated=true
docs/reference/prerequisites.md   linguist-generated=true
docs/reference/tags.md            linguist-generated=true
